hpcombi
------------------------------------------
HPCombi is a C++17 header-only library using the SSE and AVX instruction sets,
and some equivalents, for very fast manipulation of combinatorial objects such
as transformations, permutations, and boolean matrices of small size.

Runtime requirements:
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libsemigroups/HPCombi

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libsemigroups/HPCombi/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack hpcombi-1.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./hpcombi-1.1.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/hpcombi-1.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/hpcombi-1.1.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

